*In addition to {{p|Suicune}}, this card's immersive illustration features {{p|Poliwrath}}, {{p|Tentacool}}, {{p|Tentacruel}}, {{p|Slowpoke}}, {{p|Shellder}}, {{p|Krabby}}, {{p|Kingler}}, {{p|Magikarp}}, {{p|Dragonair}}, {{p|Totodile}}, {{p|Marill}}, {{p|Jumpluff}}, {{p|Quagsire}}, {{p|Phanpy}}, {{p|Crawdaunt}}, {{p|Milotic}}, {{p|Bidoof}}, {{p|Buizel}}, {{p|Swanna}}, {{p|Tynamo}}, {{p|Eelektrik}}, {{p|Drednaw}}, and {{p|Flamigo}}.
*The effects of this card's Ability and attack are similar to those of {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Suicune V|31}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

